1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,560
Choose what each gesture does.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,560
Taps, holds and swipes,
for every app or just one.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,040
Open Actions.

4
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,900
In Gesture Volume, tap Actions.

5
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:10,560
Every tap, hold and swipe the
bar understands is listed here.

6
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,394
Try a gesture on the pad.

7
00:00:12,434 --> 00:00:14,787
The pad at the top holds your real bar.

8
00:00:14,827 --> 00:00:18,960
Try a gesture on it, and the line
below says what that gesture does.

9
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,663
Pick a gesture to change.

10
00:00:20,703 --> 00:00:22,178
Tap a gesture to change it.

11
00:00:22,218 --> 00:00:24,760
Double tap does nothing
yet, so give it a job.

12
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,207
Choose an action.

13
00:00:26,247 --> 00:00:31,673
Actions come in groups: the bar, volume,
the Deck, your device, media and system.

14
00:00:31,713 --> 00:00:33,360
Tap one and you are done.

15
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,321
Give an app its own gestures.

16
00:00:36,361 --> 00:00:42,560
Under More, open Gestures for chosen
apps, tap Add and pick the app.

17
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,540
Change a gesture just there.

18
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:46,700
Set Swipe up to Increase brightness.

19
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:49,460
In Video, swiping up now
brightens the screen;

20
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,560
everywhere else it works as before.

21
00:00:52,450 --> 00:00:56,910
Up next: Make the bar yours.
